<p>Yeh Kaun Hai Falak Sara Larazta Hai<br>
Yeh Kaun Hai Zameen Ka Dil Dharkta Hai<br>
Alam Bardar Aata Hai Alam Bardar Aata Hai<br>
Yeh Lagta Hai Keh Jaisay Haider-e-Karrar Aata Hai<br>
Alam Thamay Hussaini Foaj Ka Salar Aata Hai</p>

<p>Falak Sara Larazta Hai Zameen Ka Dil Dharkta Hai<br>
Fiza Mein Shoor Barpa Hai Addo Ka Dam Nikalta Hai<br>
Jarri Yeh Kaun Aata Hai Alam Kis Ka Ubharta Hai<br>
Yazeedi Foaj Mein Halchal Dilon Pe Khof Chaya Hai</p>

<p>Jo Thi Karrar Ki Haibat Wohi Abbas Ki Haibat<br>
Khuda Ke Shair Jaisi Hai Ali Ke Shair Ki Taqat<br>
Wohi Chehra Wohi Seerat Wohi Jazba Wohi Jurat<br>
Abhi Aaya Nahi Lekin Addo Pe Cha Gayi Dehshat<br>
Misal-e-La Fatah Shabeer Ka Salar Aata Hai</p>

<p>Abhi Yeh Shoor Barpa Tha Keh Gonja Haidery Narah<br>
Misal-e-La Fatah Ghazi Achanak Samne Aaya<br>
Mujhe Abbas Kehte Hain Jarri Lalkar Kar Bola<br>
Alamdar-e-Hussaini Hoon Ghulam-e-Syed-e-Wala<br>
Sada Deta Howa Yeh Ghazi-e-Jarrar Aata Hai</p>

<p>
Yahan Tanha Dil-e-Haider Wahan Lakhon Jafa Paikar<br>
Yahan Bas Hath Mein Naiza Wahan Taig-o-Sina Khanjar<br>
Yahan Sokha Hai Mashkeza Wahan Serab Hai Lashkar<br>
Yahan Shoq-e-Shahadat Hai Wahan Shoqeen-e-Maal-o-Zar<br>
Moqabil Marhabon Ke Sahib-e-Kirdar Aata Hai</p>

<p>Addo Se Cheen Kar Darya Alam Abbas Ne Gara<br>
Yazeedi Foaj Mein Oss Dam Achanak Shoor Yeh Utha<br>
Aray Bhago Tarai Se Ali Aaya Ali Aaya<br>
Phir Oss Ke Baad Darya Par Faqat Ghazi Nazar Aaya<br>
Jafa Karoon Mein Ban Kar Maut Ki Lalkar Aata Hai</p>

<p>
Bhara Jis Waqt Mashkeza Bara Yaad Aayi Masoma<br>
Liye Pani Soye Khaima Chala Saqqa Sakina Ka<br>
Bhara Jab Gird Ghazi Ke Yazeedi Foaj Ka Halqa<br>
Kaha Abbas Ne Dil Mein Sakina Tum Na Ghabrana<br>
Abhi Le Kar Yeh Mashkeza Tera Ghamkhuwar Aata Hai</p>

<p>Alam Ghazi Dilawar Ka Jab Oss Ke Khon Mein Doba<br>
Bureda Bazoon Wala Na Mashkeza Bacha Paya<br>
Tarapta Khak Par Dekha Jo Sheh Ne Bhai Ka Lasha<br>
Wafa Ko Naaz Hai Tujh Par Pukarey Syed-e-Wala<br>
Khudaya Pas Ab Tere Mera Salar Aata Hai</p>